{"id":"f9b3394d78f2c6a42ec8a0f16bbc67e799f9ab8ff269cfec86fd951a946921c2","pubkey":"1ec454734dcbf6fe54901ce25c0c7c6bca5edd89443416761fadc321d38df139","created_at":1782693576,"content":"nostr:npub1vadcfln4ugt2h9ruwsuwu5vu5am4xaka7pw6m7axy79aqyhp6u5q9knuu7 inspired me from his post about using LLM's for encryption.\n\n\nHere is an example web page that will download GPT-2, and then encrypt a secret message, and decrypt it.\n\n\nThe encrypted message looks like regular text, but hidden in the text is a secret message.\n\n\n\n\nClearnet:\nhttps://laantungir.net/client/llm-steganography.html\n\n\nTor:\nhttp://kn2jam4kyz6s5wacyozo3do3d2zsvh4to45uh7xliulwdust6zjuvnad.onion/client/llm-steganography.html\n\n\nFIPS:\nhttp://npub1crpldvy49ef8z34wlacwujnfudy4nd7k96aqdx5wgn6ckztz7z8q9t59ud.fips/client/llm-steganography.html\n\n\nnostr:nevent1qvzqqqqqqypzqe6msnl8tcsk4w28capcaegeefmh2dmdmuza4ha6vfut6qfwr4egqqstxmgsd0egtq57gj8mghckthsv79dhegh7xh97hwtwve6l56g4s9sh48wkc","tags":[["p","675b84fe75e216ab947c7438ee519ca7775376ddf05dadfba6278bd012e1d728"],["q","b36d106bf285829e448fb45f165de0cf15b7ca2fe35cbebb96e6675fa6915816",""]]}
