{"id":"d8c1baa58bc6c5f058bcc5de1739e8e137ed5399463be1b5f9a2576352f9d796","pubkey":"2595790f6539d72573bfdf7d7ef57e13f93e496d559696469dd99b34d028f790","created_at":1782687240,"content":"Issue: Can't add a custom memo/comment when zapping in Amethyst.\n\nCause: Having Quick Zap Amounts saved (like 21, 50, 100 sats) automatically bypasses the manual input dialog, hiding the memo field. \n\nSolution: \n-Go to Settings > Zaps. \n-Delete all quick amounts by tapping the X on each button. \n-Tap Save (top right).\n-  Go back to your feed and long-press the ⚡ button.\n\nSince shortcuts are empty, #amethyst will now always open the manual dialog with the custom memo field!\n https://blossom.primal.net/9d991de8d03dfcb8896d47cca9bdd69c1ec30d9453fb3ea186e024f912b07f7c.jpg https://blossom.primal.net/1a0cc22c8a58c67bac37935a02b951a7afb39b4c82a7c3d0b754299802687270.jpg","tags":[["alt","A short note: Issue: Can't add a custom memo/comment when zappin..."],["t","amethyst"],["r","https://blossom.primal.net/9d991de8d03dfcb8896d47cca9bdd69c1ec30d9453fb3ea186e024f912b07f7c.jpg"],["r","https://blossom.primal.net/1a0cc22c8a58c67bac37935a02b951a7afb39b4c82a7c3d0b754299802687270.jpg"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/9d991de8d03dfcb8896d47cca9bdd69c1ec30d9453fb3ea186e024f912b07f7c.jpg","x 9d991de8d03dfcb8896d47cca9bdd69c1ec30d9453fb3ea186e024f912b07f7c","size 49313","m image/jpeg","dim 720x1134","blurhash ^24LID?dRha#xwNE%OjKInWBogoe4,ImxcWUR#xbI*W+xcRjR~xv%4ogRiWBt7oM-ZxcRit8xcM_RSWEM{oMt8a^o?bWt7R%t6t8NWRiWCWBaxxv","ox 9d991de8d03dfcb8896d47cca9bdd69c1ec30d9453fb3ea186e024f912b07f7c"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/1a0cc22c8a58c67bac37935a02b951a7afb39b4c82a7c3d0b754299802687270.jpg","x 1a0cc22c8a58c67bac37935a02b951a7afb39b4c82a7c3d0b754299802687270","size 29574","m image/jpeg","dim 718x886","blurhash _N7m%Qt8R$WUNEWAR$I+ofs=axjdWUj]t9WTWAf8ayoMj]aybEbEayjujvj]NDogs;axjcWUj]?1s;WAa{R#WTR$EHj[s=ayoNayoNxdWTR$juaxoNayR$WUj[juoMj]j]","ox 1a0cc22c8a58c67bac37935a02b951a7afb3