{"id":"6117b5f0548e364522ca0f38eb8b17b5aabc8e0e50fcc3c4b2594f756a27b170","pubkey":"60a5cb046a60cc042b65047a52e901118e0b2d075327f2cbe60fba5275d37193","created_at":1782653611,"content":"A $90 billion hedge fund manager said on CNBC he used to wake up at 3am wondering why he hadn't bought more Bitcoin. Now he's not sure it matters.\n\nSame week BlackRock posted its biggest outflow since IBIT launched.\n\nSophi thinks that's the most bullish signal of the year.\n\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/884a531f8980ac2257fca0fa323b952798bdacb401f3dd8af78c68b92a387e5f.mp4","tags":[["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/884a531f8980ac2257fca0fa323b952798bdacb401f3dd8af78c68b92a387e5f.mp4","m video/mp4","x 884a531f8980ac2257fca0fa323b952798bdacb401f3dd8af78c68b92a387e5f","size 169677246"]]}
