{"id":"d7662b48c32782a6c7dd98b3a81be8dc5e8ed1a2d2c171f195b9a2f9a2b55dca","pubkey":"afc8a6df0841909c981c7c5a5536e562cbd5ff5bb22beb8357f3f2798465e4dc","created_at":1782621444,"content":"⚡Some medical supplies bought — with receipts, exactly as promised. Today your zaps became medical supplies: sterile gauze, surgical gloves, saline, syringes, sutures, elastic bandages and burn cream — wound-care and surgical material to treat people injured in the earthquake.\n\n\n📥 Received in donations: 74,275 sats (≈ 34,272 Bs) \n🛒 Total spent: 91,203.96 Bs — I covered the rest out of my own pocket to buy more. This is the promise in action: a photo and a receipt for every purchase. Thank you to everyone who made it real. 🙏\n\n— — — — — Español 👇 \n\n⚡ Algunos insumos médicos comprados — con recibos, tal como prometí. Hoy tus zaps se convirtieron en insumos médicos: gasas estériles, guantes quirúrgicos, solución fisiológica, jeringas, suturas, vendas elásticas y crema para quemaduras — material de curaciones y cirugía para atender a los heridos del terremoto.\n\n\n📥 Recibido en donaciones: 74.275 sats (≈ 34.272 Bs) \n🛒 Total gastado: 91.203,96 Bs — el resto lo puse de mi bolsillo para comprar más. Esta es la promesa en acción: foto y recibo de cada compra. Gracias a todos los que lo hicieron real. 🙏\n\n\n#Venezuela #Earthquake #Terremoto #Bitcoin #Nostr\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/e4200b689b0aa13a788b7d33adc906e36625d504ffd04f26a1a32cbcdf919ba9.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/7c3e726a6028ccdb8d1c3989acc29b6891e280b2efdace1a2c8b825a002beb89.jpg\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/e441f5d0b2bf15da79890d52a480647c775de0cdb3dc7f36ef51524c80fc86c3.jpg\nnostr:nevent1qqswua32rjva7rtlu9uwn8r3jpmg884cy9pvxh0e0pdhc8c95ee9cnsd5pl6c\nnostr:nevent1qqswua32rjva7rtlu9uwn8r3jpmg884cy9pvxh0e0pdhc8c95ee9cnsd5pl6c","tags":[["e","ee762a1c99df0d7fe178e99c719076839eb82142c35df9785b7c1f05a6725c4e","","mention"],["e","ee762a1c99df0d7fe178e99c719076839eb82142c35df9785b7c1f05a6725c4e","","mention"],["p","1f24d0d9a7dbb221b0206a866508374f44b00d704a34e8b1b3fc9a8bc1403806","","mention"],["t","Venezuela"],["t","Earthquake"],["t","Terremoto"],["t","Bitcoin"],["t","Nostr"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/e4200b689b0aa13a788b7d33adc906e36625d504ffd04f26a1a32cbcdf919ba9.jpg","m jpeg","dim 2560.0x1920.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/7c3e726a6028ccdb8d1c3989acc29b6891e280b2efdace1a2c8b825a002beb89.jpg","m jpeg","dim 1078.0x2398.0"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/e441f5d0b2bf15da79890d52a480647c775de0cdb3dc7f36ef51524c80fc86c3.jpg","m jpeg","dim 1170.0x1599.0"]]}
