{"id":"ce2a1cf775ca9d330e9c3355b3764b8b101c96c306b4c138f92133795a73c787","pubkey":"f648d9238a4541c10145f11d8532c529089bfa23c017c1b959c5c26d820d7bb9","created_at":1782617333,"content":"儿子985毕业进大厂，我53岁送外卖供他租房，他说：爸我不想卷了 https://c.m.163.com/news/a/L0F150850556H1AQ.html?spss=newsapp&spsnuid=Jp6fuSjsAR2oFVxv5Gm586lyorXc%2F6gpWHEH1XWfz24%3D&spsdevid=EC27087F-2F83-485C-92AD-C799F16CA214&spsvid=&spsshare=default&spsts=1782617154736&spstoken=HzshYmGYnN%2Fimk5sjN7oKeRzigaRV9YN7RFg8%2BEyzKIK8SM6GiWbSGkMV2ymLWVFN9zJnEIAqjcEA%2Fe%2BwfFsBw%3D%3D\n\n女人和中国男人结婚生孩子都是这样下场。年轻女孩子嫁中国男人就是很凄惨下场。孩子继续当奴隶。女孩子趁年轻赶紧找老外男人结婚生孩子，跟欧美男人结婚生孩子当公民。与中国男人生孩子，孩子当奴隶贱民，没意义。嫁中国男人最凄惨最错误投资。是傻逼女人嫁中国男人生奴隶孩子，孩子很凄惨读985，211，读清华北大出来也是奴隶贱民。","tags":[["r","https://c.m.163.com/news/a/L0F150850556H1AQ.html?spss=newsapp&spsnuid=Jp6fuSjsAR2oFVxv5Gm586lyorXc%2F6gpWHEH1XWfz24%3D&spsdevid=EC27087F-2F83-485C-92AD-C799F16CA214&spsvid=&spsshare=default&spsts=1782617154736&spstoken=HzshYmGYnN%2Fimk5sjN7oKeRzigaRV9YN7RFg8%2BEyzKIK8SM6GiWbSGkMV2ymLWVFN9zJnEIAqjcEA%2Fe%2BwfFsBw%3D%3D"]]}
