{"id":"9ced9190d7e1914bc89c6996aab224a3ceb3fdf1dc2880e8ac0c1f316f64e33e","pubkey":"813a2cfda49a8801e21bed3c2380e786fa4cad753dd15b1af19a37a815579579","created_at":1782611812,"content":"nostr:nprofile1qythwumn8ghj7mn0wd68ytnp0faxzmt09ehx2ap0qyg8wumn8ghj7mn0wd68ytnvdakz7qpqe0f072k223nkn2x6dvknsak6g7spae5s92xwqc9f24r3kzujkytq4gyvuu and I have been quietly working on my next release since March. Somewhere along the way, it became something that surprised us both - a song that deserves a little more space to breathe.\n\nAnd today was a special day 💜\n\nI took my very first dance lesson with my choreographer friend, Lisa 💃\n\nWe'll be creating an original choreography for the music video 👀\n\nI've always admired dancers. Watching them makes it look effortless. Trying it yourself reminds you that every graceful movement is years of proof of work hidden beneath a few seconds of beauty.\n\nThe #LivyLumi  stream on nostr:nprofile1qyt8wumn8ghj7mn0wd68yetvd96x2uewdaexwtcpz4mhxue69uhhyetvv9ujuerpd46hxtnfduhsqgy9muq29a4frpzn2nyd9k0m4dqq9wu9ks39ht4tvra0kfv8c5pcagxg0wze captured a little moment from the end of our class ✨\n\nWhen was the last time you went on a side quest?\nhttps://blossom.primal.net/153cdb5afda5b5cf98321dfdf3d51a6ae3c6abdab75768316f561cf29e5c96fa.mov ","tags":[["t","LivyLumi"],["p","cbd2ff2aca546769a8da6b2d3876da47a01ee6902a8ce060a955471b0b92b116","wss://nostr.azzamo.net/","mention"],["p","85df00a2f6a91845354c8d2d9fbab4002bb85b4225baeab60fafb2587c5038ea","wss://nostrelites.org/","mention"],["r","wss://sendit.nosflare.com/"],["r","wss://relay.ditto.pub/"],["r","wss://relay.damus.io/"],["r","wss://relay.dreamith.to/"],["r","wss://relay.momostr.pink/"],["r","wss://nostr.wine/"],["r","wss://nos.lol/"],["r","wss://relay.mostr.pub/"],["r","wss://relay.primal.net/"],["imeta","url https://blossom.primal.net/153cdb5afda5b5cf98321dfdf3d51a6ae3c6abdab75768316f561cf29e5c96fa.mov","m video/quicktime","dim 480x852","duration 40.830013","bitrate 741088.179423308","service nip96"]